    {
      "id": "17905379289537740",
      "text": "Nenek aku selalu bilang, jangan tidur sebelum baca Al-Waqiah — apapun kondisinya, sesibuk apapun malam itu.\nDulu aku ang",
      "permalink": "https://www.threads.com/@_iame.hijrah/post/DcTjo_TFF0e",
      "timestamp": "2026-08-21T14:31:16+0000",
